# Desktop runtime dependencies for the Katherine .deb (#338).
#
# This is a DELIBERATELY SEPARATE lock from backend/requirements.in:
# the .deb ships only what the desktop runtime imports (the companion
# graph + the lazy remote provider), not the cloud/web stack (FastAPI,
# uvicorn, Supabase, torch, sentence-transformers) that the desktop
# never loads (proven by backend/tests/test_desktop_import_isolation.py).
#
# Versions mirror backend/requirements.txt pins so the packaged app
# runs the same code as the checkout.
#
# Native/system dependencies (NOT pip): python3-gi, WebKitGTK 4.1,
# GTK 3 — provided by the .deb Depends field, matching the validated
# environment of docs/operations/desktop-shell-linux.md.

